flowchart TD
    Request["Notification API request"] --> Security{"Authenticated?"}
    Security -->|No| Unauthorized["Existing shared 401 Problem Details"]
    Security -->|Yes| Controller["NotificationController"]
    Controller --> Service["NotificationService"]
    Service --> Mutation["Conditional SQL: resource ID + account ID"]
    Mutation -->|One row| Success["Existing success response"]
    Mutation -->|Zero rows: notification| NotificationError["NotificationNotFoundException"]
    Mutation -->|Zero rows: subscription| SubscriptionError["NotificationSubscriptionNotFoundException"]
    NotificationError --> Neutral["ApplicationException + NotificationErrors"]
    SubscriptionError --> Neutral
    Neutral --> Adapter["Existing RFC 9457 REST adapter"]
    Adapter --> Safe404["Ownership-private 404 Problem Details"]
    Mutation -->|Unexpected failure| Internal["Existing generic 500 path"]
